<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-WOMEN'S PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WOMEN'S PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the $450.000 Paris Open</p>
<p>women's tennis tournament on Wednesday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>6-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Nathalie Dechy (France) 2-6</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Chanda Rubin (U.S.) beat Nicole Arendt (U.S.) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>Yayuk Basuki (Indonesia) beat Barbara Schett (Austria) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) beat Florencia Labat (Argentina) 6-1</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Second round 1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 6-3 6-4  </p>
<p>Add second round:</p>
<p>4-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) 6-4 6-3</p>
</text>
